56
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:13,520
X-rays completely, again, no information

57
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:15,680
escapes. The useful case is partial

58
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:17,920
absorption. Different tissues absorb

59
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:20,000
X-rays to different degrees. That

60
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:21,520
difference creates contrast and contrast

61
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,440
is what carries the diagnostic

62
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:25,360
information.

63
