453
00:17:08,799 --> 00:17:12,959
Now let's take a closer look at how an

454
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:15,439
X-ray tube works because this is the

455
00:17:12,959 --> 00:17:17,439
heart of the X-ray source. The figure

456
00:17:15,439 --> 00:17:19,280
